&#x017F;ta&#x0364;nde &#x2014; Es pocht jemand.</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>Herein!</p></sp></div><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b">Zwey-</hi></fw><lb/>
