<sp who="#MIN"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Das Fra&#x0364;ulein.</hi></speaker> <p>Das Fra&#x0364;ulein von Barnhelm.</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Wirth.</hi></speaker> <stage>(&#x017F;chreibt)</stage> <p>&#x201E;von Barnhelm&#x201E; &#x2014;<lb/>
