<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Wirth.</hi></speaker> <p>Eine Su&#x0364;nde? behu&#x0364;te! das wa&#x0364;re<lb/>
