<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Ju&#x017F;t.</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="78" facs="#f0082"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">Minna von Barnhelm,</hi></fw><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</sp><lb/>
<sp who="#JUS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ju&#x017F;t.</hi></speaker> <p>Das kann man nun eben nicht &#x017F;agen;<lb/>
