Weg.</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>O der Bube!</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#JUS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ju&#x017F;t.</hi></speaker> <p>Aber ein perfecter La&#x0364;uffer i&#x017F;t er, das i&#x017F;t<lb/>
