<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>Was denn?</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Wirth.</hi></speaker> <p>Hat es Jhr das gna&#x0364;dige Fra&#x0364;u-<lb/>
