<sp who="#TEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">v. Tellheim.</hi></speaker> <p>Woher kenn&#x017F;t du &#x017F;ie denn al&#x017F;o?</p><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Wer-</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="105" facs="#f0109"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">oder das Soldatenglu&#x0364;ck.</hi></fw><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WAC"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Werner.</hi></speaker> <p>Un&#x017F;ere Bekannt&#x017F;chaft i&#x017F;t noch blut<lb/>
