<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>Herr Major &#x2014;</p><lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">G 5</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">v. Tell-</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="106" facs="#f0110"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">Minna von Barnhelm,</hi></fw><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</sp><lb/>
<sp who="#TEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">v. Tellheim.</hi></speaker> <p>Liebe Franciska, ich habe dich<lb/>
