<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>Nun, Herr Wachmei&#x017F;ter? &#x2014;</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WAC"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Werner.</hi></speaker> <p>Frauenzimmerchen, wenn ich wie-<lb/>
