<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franciska.</hi></speaker> <p>So wollen Sie &#x017F;einer ent&#x017F;agen?</p> </sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIN"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Das Fra&#x0364;ulein.</hi></speaker> <p>Ey, &#x017F;ieh doch! Jammert er<lb/>
