Wirth?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Wirth.</hi></speaker> <p>Wollen Jhro Excellenz nur die<lb/>
Gnade haben, hier herein zu treten.</p><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Der</hi></fw><lb/>
